    <string name="instagram_proxy_info_text"><![CDATA[<b>Primary</b> — toinstagram.com, adamlikes.men<br/>Embed media <i>and</i> the post / reel title and description.<br/><br/><b>Backup</b> — instagram7.com, kkinstagram.com<br/>Embed media only (no title or description).<br/><br/><b>Custom</b> — proxies you add yourself<br/>Any Instagram embed proxy domain you enter is used as-is for the domain swap; the app never contacts it. What gets embedded depends on that proxy.<br/><br/>Use a backup if both primary proxies stop responding. Converted links are sent without the <tt>www.</tt> prefix because these proxies render best that way.]]></string>
