    <string name="tiktok_proxy_info_text"><![CDATA[<b>Primary</b> — tnktok.com, tfxktok.com<br/>Embed videos <i>and</i> multi-image slideshows, with like / comment / share counts.<br/><br/><b>Backup</b> — tiktokez.com, kktiktok.com<br/>tiktokez.com embeds media like the primaries; kktiktok.com embeds the video only (no slideshows, no stats).<br/><br/><b>Custom</b> — proxies you add yourself<br/>Any TikTok embed proxy domain you enter is used as-is for the domain swap; the app never contacts it. What gets embedded depends on that proxy.<br/><br/>Use a backup if both primary proxies stop responding. Converted links keep their original host prefix (<tt>vm.</tt>, <tt>www.</tt>, …) because TikTok share links live on subdomains and the proxies mirror them.]]></string>
    <string name="tiktok_proxy_info_content_desc">More info about TikTok proxies</string>
    

    
