    <string name="about_text">FixupXer cleans URLs and converts links for better embedding and sharing.\n\nVersion %1$s\n\nLicensed under GPL-3.0-or-later</string>
    <string name="about_dialog_positive">OK</string>
    <string name="license_info">This app is free software licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0 or later. You can view the source code at https://github.com/NeatCode-Labs/fixupxer</string>
    <string name="bug_report_email">neatcodelabs@gmail.com</string>
    <string name="bug_report_subject">FixupXer Bug Report</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_dialog_title">Disclaimer</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_text"><![CDATA[<b>Privacy Statement</b><br/> This app processes URLs locally on your device and does not transmit any user data or URLs to external servers. If history is enabled, processed URLs are stored locally on your device only and can be cleared at any time.<br/><br/> <b>History Feature</b><br/> The optional history feature stores your URL conversions locally on your device. This data never leaves your device and can be disabled or cleared at any time through the History settings.<br/><br/> <b>Clipboard Access</b><br/> By using the Paste button, the app reads your last clipboard entry and checks if it\'s a valid link. By using that button, you acknowledge this access.<br/><br/> <b>URL Modifications</b><br/> While we strive to maintain URL functionality, some links may not work as expected after cleaning. Users can always use the original URL if needed. Proxy services such as facebookez.com, fixupx.com, adamlikes.men, toinstagram.com, instagram7.com, kkinstagram.com, tnktok.com, tfxktok.com, tiktokez.com and kktiktok.com are not owned or maintained by us and may stop working at any given time. The same applies to any custom proxy domains you add yourself.<br/><br/> <b>Third-Party Services</b><br/> This app is not affiliated with nor endorses usage of third-party proxy services such as facebookez.com, fixupx.com, adamlikes.men, toinstagram.com, instagram7.com, kkinstagram.com, tnktok.com, tfxktok.com, tiktokez.com and kktiktok.com, nor of any custom proxy services you configure yourself. These services are independent and may have their own terms and privacy policies.<br/><br/> <b>Trademarks</b><br/> Names of the applications such as Facebook, Twitter, X, Instagram, TikTok and others whose links this application cleans from tracking are trademarks of their respective owners. This application is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or associated with those services.<br/><br/> <b>External Links</b><br/> Cleaned URLs will open in your device\'s default browser or the respective app. We are not responsible for content on external websites.<br/><br/> <b>Disclaimer of Warranty</b><br/> This software is provided as is, without warranty of any kind, express or implied, including but not limited to the warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose and noninfringement.<br/><br/> <b>License</b><br/> FixupXer is free software licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0 or later (GPL-3.0-or-later). You have the freedom to use, modify, and distribute this software under the terms of the GPL. Source code is available at https://github.com/NeatCode-Labs/fixupxer]]></string>
    
